stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready --> Ready : CapacityRefuse
    Ready --> Extending : Reserve [space]
    Extending --> Ready : Commit [probes seeded]
    Extending --> Degraded : Fail or time out
    Extending --> Cancelling : ObserveCancel [request EOF]
    Cancelling --> Ready : Rollback [verified]
    Cancelling --> Degraded : RollbackRefused
    Degraded --> Ready : Rollback [verified]
    Extending --> Interrupted : Crash
    Cancelling --> Interrupted : Crash
    Degraded --> Interrupted : Crash
    Interrupted --> Reconciled : Reconcile
    Ready --> Cleaning : Down
    Extending --> Cleaning : Down cancels start
    Cancelling --> Cleaning : Down
    Degraded --> Cleaning : Down
    Reconciled --> Cleaning : Down
    Cleaning --> Stopped : FinishDown
    note right of Extending
      Create, Start, Publish
      INV Existing IDs stay
    end note
    note right of Degraded
      RefuseConcurrent
      Keep cleanup intent
    end note
    note right of Cancelling
      Client waits for reply
      Rollback reply confirms
      Commit or timeout is unknown
    end note
    classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    class Extending,Cleaning live
    class Interrupted,Degraded fail
    class Cancelling,Reconciled wait
    class Stopped ok
